","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 15/30. I must follow doctrine: take East Ford (F3) in the first 5 watches, and now hold it. My units are already at F3. I will reinforce the hold and prepare for the last-watch charge."},{"seq":723,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c243","house":"kite","letter":"L285","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":724,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c244","house":"kite","letter":"L286","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4200,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":725,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c245","house":"kite","letter":"L287","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":4200,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":726,"t":4200,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1701,"retries":0},{"seq":727,"t":4200,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is at F2 and SBM. Tiger is at F1 and SBM. I need to secure a ford. I will move archers to F1/F2 to contest the enemy presence and establish a foothold, following doctrine."},{"seq":728,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c246","house":"orchid","letter":"L288","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west"],"depart":4200,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":729,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c247","house":"orchid","letter":"L289","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1","n-west"],"depart":4200,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":730,"t":4200,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1885,"retries":0},{"seq":731,"t":4200,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"My doctrine says take the west ford early and hold it. I have a unit at F1 (West Ford) from 7w ago, but it's old. Rhino infantry is there, and Orchid archers are there. I should reinforce F1 and try to hold it, as per doctrine, while keeping an eye on the threats.\n\nRhino has forc"},{"seq":732,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c248","house":"tiger","letter":"L290","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west","F1"],"depart":4500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"ECNOQ EKKQ, BKGI SQ WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":733,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c249","house":"tiger","letter":"L291","kind":"order","to":"tiger-cav-1","path":["tiger-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"BKNOP, HSNRB QK WPOQ EKNI."},{"seq":734,"t":4209,"type":"delivered","courier":"c217","letter":"L252","house":"rhino"},{"seq":735,"t":4209,"type":"intel","house":"rhino","letter":"L241","from":"tiger","text":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","plain":false},{"seq":736,"t":4209,"type":"delivered","courier":"c218","letter":"L253","house":"rhino"},{"seq":737,"t":4214,"type":"delivered","courier":"c216","letter":"L251","house":"tiger"},{"seq":738,"t":4214,"type":"truce","a":"tiger","b":"orchid","until":19},{"seq":739,"t":4269,"type":"delivered","courier":"c209","letter":"L244","house":"rhino"},{"seq":740,"t":4289,"type":"delivered","courier":"c230","letter":"L272","house":"rhino"},{"seq":741,"t":4329,"type":"delivered","courier":"c215","letter":"L250","house":"tiger"},{"seq":742,"t":4329,"type":"delivered","courier":"c228","letter":"L267","house":"tiger"},{"seq":743,"t":4396,"type":"delivered","courier":"c243","letter":"L285","house":"kite"},{"seq":744,"t":4396,"type":"delivered","courier":"c244","letter":"L286","house":"kite"},{"seq":745,"t":4396,"type":"delivered","courier":"c245","letter":"L287","house":"kite"},{"seq":746,"t":4409,"type":"delivered","courier":"c232","letter":"L274","house":"rhino"},{"seq":747,"t":4429,"type":"delivered","courier":"c242","letter":"L284","house":"rhino"},{"seq":748,"t":4454,"type":"caught","courier":"c247","letter":"L289","house":"orchid","by":"rhino